Core/Jessie: They’re reacting to my flashlight.
Core/Rose: Of course they are. Phototropism.
Core/Jessie: Photo-what-now?
Core/Rose: Plants grow toward light. These things… they’ve still got that instinct baked in.
Core/Rose: But if you keep the beam on them, they’ll lock onto it. And you.
Core/Jessie: So basically, don’t be stupid with the light.
Core/Rose: Exactly.